## configure.upsert, root here, the timer masked
   • <fix>/live/52grove-unattended-upgrades written
   • <fix>/live/grove-unattended-keep-conffiles.conf written
   • <fix>/live/unit.d/52grove-keep-conffiles.conf written
   ✋ ConstraintError: a masked apt timer, so the policy on disk never runs (apt-daily.timer apt-daily-upgrade.timer)
      ⇒ a mask is an admin's own refusal, and this apply does not lift it
      fix: if the box should take security updates, lift it, then re-apply —
        sudo systemctl unmask apt-daily.timer apt-daily-upgrade.timer
        rhx grove.provision --what 1.14.updates --mode apply

